ENTRY            D8124   20260825   20261124   20261124       D153
SUBENT        D8124001   20260825   20261124   20261124       D153
BIB                 14         26
TITLE      Fusion hindrance in 12C+19F: Insights into
            astrophysics
AUTHOR     (M.Del Fabbro, A.M.Stefanini, G.Montagnoli, G.Colucci,
            G.Andreetta, M.Balogh, L.Busak, L.Corradi ,
            E.Fioretto, F.Galtarossa, A.Goasduff, A.Gozzelino,
            T.Mijatovic, J.Pellumaj, E.Pilotto, F.Simioni,
            S.Szilner, A.Togni, A.Trzcinska, M.Wolinska-Cichocka)
INSTITUTE  (3CRORBZ,2ITYPAD,2ITYUPV,3POLWWA)
REFERENCE  (J,PR/C,114,024601,2026)
FACILITY   (VDGT,2ITYPAD) XTU Tandem accelerator
SAMPLE     (6-C-12,ENR=0.999) 50 ug/cm2
METHOD     (EDE,TOF)
ANALYSIS   Angular distribution was measured at Ebeam=23.0 MeV,
            and assumed the same shape at all energies.
REL-REF    (N,,D.G.Kovar+,J,PR/C,20,1305,1979)
           Absolute cross-section scale normalized to the
            lowest-energy experimental data point of D.G.Kovar
             et al.
DETECTOR   (TELES,MCPLT,IOCH,SI)
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-SYS) absolute cross section scale (~6%)
           (ERR-S) purely statistical
ADD-RES    An upper limit of 69 ub at Ebeam=15.5 MeV.
STATUS     (TABLE,,M.Del Fabbro+,J,PR/C,114,024601,2026) Fig.3
           (APRVD) Proofread by Alberto Stefanini (2026-08-26)
HISTORY    (20260824R) Received by e-mail from Alberto Stefanini
           (20260825C) M.Odsuren, N.Otsuka
ENDBIB              26
COMMON               1          3
ERR-SYS
PER-CENT
 6.
